      "source": [
        "# Disease (Lesion) Segmentation\n",
        "Recommended dataset: **IDRiD lesion segmentation** (medium-sized, pixel-level lesion masks).\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Repository setup\n",
        "This notebook expects the repository `src` folder on the Python path.\n"
